<title>UK: Lehman sets call, put warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets call, put warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued a total of 2.5 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.MAR.97-13.MAR.98   PAYDATE	19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  18,570 YEN		   * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL 26     19,000 YEN  $11.40    9.77 PCT    13.41 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL 27     21,000 YEN  $ 6.15   16.95 PCT    24.85 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL 28     23,000 YEN  $ 3.06   25.86 PCT    49.95 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT 14     18,000 YEN  $10.25    9.78 PCT    14.91 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT 15     20,000 YEN  $19.73    5.21 PCT     7.75 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
